{{知识点名称}}G组核心词汇{{知识点内容}}garrulous（话多的）同义loquacious/verbose，反义taciturn/reticent；germane（有关的）同义relevant/pertinent；glacial（冰川的）同义frigid/icy；glib（油嘴滑舌的）同义slick/superficial；gregarious（合群的）同义sociable/outgoing；guileless（坦率的）同义naive/artful；gullible（容易受骗的）同义credulous/naive。▮{{知识点名称}}H-I组核心词汇{{知识点内容}}hackneyed（陈腐的）同义trite/clichéd；hapless（不幸的）同义unfortunate/unlucky；harangue（长篇大论的演说）同义tirade/diatribe；hegemony（霸权）同义dominance/supremacy；iconoclast（偶像破坏者）同义rebel/nonconformist；illicit（非法的）同义illegal/unlawful；imbue（浸透）同义permeate/infuse；immutable（不可变的）同义unchangeable/fixed；impartial（公正的）同义unbiased/neutral；impede（阻碍）同义hinder/obstruct；imperious（专横的）同义domineering/arrogant；imperturbable（沉着的）同义composed/unflappable；impervious（不受影响的）同义immune/resistant；impetuous（冲动的）同义impulsive/rash；implacable（不可安抚的）同义relentless/unyielding；implicit（含蓄的）同义implied/unspoken；impugn（质疑）同义challenge/question；inchoate（刚开始的）同义rudimentary/nascent；incisive（敏锐的）同义sharp/penetrating；incongruous（不协调的）同义incompatible/mismatched；incorrigible（不可救药的）同义irredeemable/unreformable；indifferent（冷漠的）同义apathetic/unconcerned；indigent（贫困的）同义impoverished/destitute；indolent（懒惰的）同义lazy/slothful；ineffable（难以言表的）同义inexpressible/indescribable；ingenuous（天真的）同义naive/candid；inimical（敌意的）同义hostile/adverse；insipid（乏味的）同义bland/dull；intransigent（不妥协的）同义uncompromising/rigid；inundate（淹没）同义overwhelm/flood；invective（辱骂）同义abuse/vitriol；irascible（易怒的）同义irritable/choleric。▮{{知识点名称}}L组核心词汇{{知识点内容}}laconic（简洁的）同义terse/succinct；lament（哀叹）同义mourn/grieve；languid（倦怠的）同义lethargic/listless；laudable（值得赞扬的）同义commendable/praiseworthy；lethargic（昏昏欲睡的）同义sluggish/torpid；levity（轻浮）同义frivolity/lightheartedness；lucid（清晰的）同义clear/coherent。▮{{知识点名称}}M组核心词汇{{知识点内容}}magnanimous（宽宏大量的）同义generous/noble；malinger（装病逃避）同义shirk/loaf；malleable（可塑的）同义pliable/adaptable；maverick（特立独行的人）同义rebel/nonconformist；mercurial（善变的）同义volatile/capricious；meticulous（一丝不苟的）同义scrupulous/punctilious；mollify（安抚）同义appease/soothe；morose（阴郁的）同义sullen/gloomy；munificent（慷慨的）同义generous/lavish；myriad（无数的）同义countless/innumerable。